{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/36933-weird-revelations-from-a-nudw-fan","id":36933,"title":"Weird revelations from a NuDW fan","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-25T09:03:32-08:00","id":36933,"title":"Weird revelations from a NuDW fan","content":"Odd revelation. Very soon, Matt Smith will not be the Doctor. I have followed this show since it got rebooted back in the Eccleston days, but I never really had MY doctor until Smith. Tennant was too sexy and Eccleston was too angry. But a Doctor who thought bunkbeds were cool? Who screwed up his catchphrase within his first episode? Who was silly and awkward and totally, unashamedly smart? Oh yes, that would do it for me, alright.<br /> <br /> And in two and a half hours (well, two and a half to three and a half depending on when he regenerates) Matt Smith won't be the Doctor anymore.<br /> <br /> Just an odd something I realized.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/768-djehuty3","name":"djehuty3","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-25T21:13:31-08:00","id":37143,"title":"","content":"Indeed Smith was one of my favorites too. Sorry to see him gone but he had a great send off, worthy of him.<br /> <br /> Bow-ties and fezzes will always be cool!<br /> <br /> Now we wait and see how the 12th Doctor plays out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-26T02:33:34-08:00","id":37250,"title":"","content":"I grew up on Tom Baker, and got my girl into the show with Tenant (though we both like Smith). The other day she was rattling on about how great Tenant was and I asked her, &quot;So you really think for the hundred year anniversary they'll bring out an old Tenant at the end for the fans?&quot; She was not amused.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ortam + Malkavia makes a Requiem fun.<br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Posts in this colour are Persuasion.</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\">Posts in this colour are Seduction.</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this colour are Intimidation.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/57-solomon-birch","name":"solomon birch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar57_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"289"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}